  "description": "After being unfairly framed in devildom, middle-tier devil Sitri falls onto Earth as a human and searches for a serial killer who could take him back to his origin. He meets a stubborn, strict human boss who he initially hates; however, he eventually starts having feelings for her. Love has no limits, but... does it really? What will be their fate? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
